ion_ratio: [0.05, 0.34]\n      power_theory_r_squared: [0.50, 0.79]\n      leaderboard_models_scanned: [12, 80]\n      leaderboard_flagged_rate: [0.00, 0.03]\n      baseline_auroc_advantage_vs_constat: [-0.15, -0.02]\n      two_sided_inverted_u_inflection_contam_level: [0.25, 0.50]\n      mmlu_power_at_5pct_contam: [0.05, 0.20]\n    narrative_direction: >\n      核心假设不成立——binary response 的信息量不足以检测现实水平的 SFT 污染。必须 reframe，但不降级 venue。\n      新 angle：\"IRT person-fit 作为 benchmark integrity 的必要条件检查（necessary but not sufficient）\"。\n      Reframe 逻辑：(1) 将 lz* 定位为\"极端污染的高置信度筛选器\"而非通用检测器——Gemini-1.5 的 lz*=+34.75\n      仍是强结果，说明极端 case 的检出是 zero-cost（无需 access）的；(2) 将控制实验的\"负面结果\"本身作为贡献——\n      \"我们严格量化了 binary response 检测的信息论下界，证明 SFT 泛化是 binary-only 检测的根本瓶颈\"；\n      (3) 用 information-theoretic framing 构建 detection frontier 的完整图景——我们的负面结果 + 文献\n      正面结果共同刻画了\"信息量 vs 检测力\"的 Pareto 前沿。(4) 发展\"多统计量融合\"方向——lz* + outfit + infit\n      的联合检验是否能突破单统计量的信息瓶颈。Headline 变为：\"Binary response 检测的信息论极限：\n      IRT person-fit 何时足够、何时不够\"。EMNLP 仍可投——负面结果 + 理论分析 + frontier 框架\n      对评估方法论社区同样有价值。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c14acc35-e720-45e2-8dc2-a986c6e07456","total_cost_usd":0.16445449999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9836,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":3686,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9836,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3686,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9836,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9836},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4794,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.004899,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6